GIVEN item IS A STRING
GIVETH A MAYBE `sch 4 row`
`sch 4 part 3 the row for the item` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF item EQUALS "1" THEN JUST `sch 4 part 3 item 1 row`
        IF item EQUALS "2" THEN JUST `sch 4 part 3 item 2 row`
        IF item EQUALS "3" THEN JUST `sch 4 part 3 item 3 row`
        IF item EQUALS "4" THEN JUST `sch 4 part 3 item 4 row`
        IF item EQUALS "5" THEN JUST `sch 4 part 3 item 5 row`
        IF item EQUALS "6" THEN JUST `sch 4 part 3 item 6 row`
        IF item EQUALS "7" THEN JUST `sch 4 part 3 item 7 row`
        IF item EQUALS "8" THEN JUST `sch 4 part 3 item 8 row`
        IF item EQUALS "9" THEN JUST `sch 4 part 3 item 9 row`
        IF item EQUALS "10" THEN JUST `sch 4 part 3 item 10 row`
        IF item EQUALS "10 (in addition, each exhibit)" THEN JUST `sch 4 part 3 item 10 (in addition, each exhibit) row`
        IF item EQUALS "11" THEN JUST `sch 4 part 3 item 11 row`
        IF item EQUALS "12" THEN JUST `sch 4 part 3 item 12 row`
        IF item EQUALS "13" THEN JUST `sch 4 part 3 item 13 row`
        IF item EQUALS "13A" THEN JUST `sch 4 part 3 item 13A row`
        IF item EQUALS "14" THEN JUST `sch 4 part 3 item 14 row`
        IF item EQUALS "14(a)" THEN JUST `sch 4 part 3 item 14(a) row`
        IF item EQUALS "14(b)" THEN JUST `sch 4 part 3 item 14(b) row`
        IF item EQUALS "15" THEN JUST `sch 4 part 3 item 15 row`
        IF item EQUALS "16" THEN JUST `sch 4 part 3 item 16 row`
        IF item EQUALS "17" THEN JUST `sch 4 part 3 item 17 row`
        IF item EQUALS "18" THEN JUST `sch 4 part 3 item 18 row`
        OTHERWISE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the Fourth Schedule has no such item in this Part

-- ===========================================================================
§ `Fourth Schedule Part 3 -- what the text says besides the table`
-- ===========================================================================

-- src:8563 | Service provision fees must be paid in the manner set out in the table below or at any such other time or manner that the Registrar of the Supreme Court or State Courts (as the case may be) may determine. Items
@ref Sch 4 part 3 (src:8563)
GIVEN `the fee is a service provision fee in Part 3` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the fee is paid in the manner set out in the table` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the fee is paid at the time or in the manner the Registrar of the Supreme Court or State Courts (as the case may be) has determined` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`sch 4 part 3 the service provision fee is paid as the Schedule requires` MEANS
    IF NOT (`the fee is a service provision fee in Part 3`)
    THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "Service provision fees must be paid"
    ELSE IF `the fee is paid in the manner set out in the table` OR `the fee is paid at the time or in the manner the Registrar of the Supreme Court or State Courts (as the case may be) has determined`
         THEN JUST TRUE
         ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): a bare "must be paid"; the Schedule does not say what follows

