    THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "On every request for certified true copies of documents from the Court file"
    ELSE IF `the copies are transcripts certified by a provider of transcription services authorised by the Court`
         THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "the fee under this item is not to be collected for transcripts certified by a provider of transcription services authorised by the Court"
         ELSE JUST TRUE

